@startuml sequence-check-availability
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
title Sequence — Check availability (UC4a, included in UC4 and UC8)
participant ":ReservationService" as Res
participant "other : Reservation" as O

[-> Res : is_car_available(c, start, end)
loop for each CONFIRMED reservation of car c
  Res -> O : overlaps(start, end)
  O --> Res : true / false
  break overlaps
    [<-- Res : false (car not available)
  end
end
[<-- Res : true (car available)

note over Res, O
  DRAFT and CANCELLED reservations are not checked —
  only a CONFIRMED one blocks the slot.
  In the code this is one database query
  (crud.is_car_available).
end note
@enduml
